	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Quę misisti, accepi omnia et gratiam habeo, quantam possum maximam, missurus cras <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>aut postridie <placeName ref="l441">Schafhusium</placeName> ad <persName>Ruggerum</persName>.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Nihil praeterea ista temporis contractione <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>possum nec quicquam habeo, quod significem, nisi quod <placeName ref="l18">Augusta</placeName> et <placeName ref="l473">Sangallo</placeName> scribitur <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>pontificem <placeName ref="l1176">Marsiliam</placeName> proditione capere voluisse, sed fractos impiissimi tyranni conatus.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="de">23. m<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>ar[tii].</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z6"/>Video dominum non dignum ducere <placeName ref="l1209">Navarrum</placeName>, cuius <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>opera regnum suum in <placeName ref="l832">Galliis</placeName> amplificet, quum talis <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>sit, qualem eum mihi in superiore quadam epistola depinxisti.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z9"/>Interim nihilosecus proferentur p r omeria regni <persName>Davidic<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>i</persName> invitis inferorum portis.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Sed nobis sedulo ardentissimeque <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>precandum, ut afflictis illis <placeName ref="l832">Gallię</placeName> ecclesiis et ministris propicius adsit.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Est, qui dicat etiam apud <placeName ref="l875">Hispanos</placeName> et <placeName ref="l2530">Portugallenses</placeName> semina <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>quędam egregia Christi evangelii iacta, quę pulchre etiam suppullulent.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z14"/>Da wurde <persName>Philippus</persName> erst rasig und unsinnig, wann im unser <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>herrgott zuͦ nach wellte; das wurd erst vyl bluͦt geben.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/>Si quid de hoc certius cognoveris, fac sciam, quod ipse tibi <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>quoque, si rescivero, tibi lętus significabo.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>D. <persName ref="p495">Bullingero</persName> suo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
